{"page":488,"verses":[{"verse_key":"42:45","surah":42,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَتَرَىٰهُمْ يُعْرَضُونَ عَلَيْهَا خَـٰشِعِينَ مِنَ ٱلذُّلِّ يَنظُرُونَ مِن طَرْفٍ خَفِىٍّ ۗ وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ ٱلَّذِينَ خَسِرُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَأَهْلِيهِمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ أَلَآ إِنَّ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ فِى عَذَابٍ مُّقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You will see them exposed to the Fire, abject in humiliation, glancing furtively, while those who believed exclaim, ‘The losers are the ones who have lost themselves and their people on the Day of Resurrection.’ Truly the evildoers will remain in lasting torment;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتَرَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"And you will see them","transliteration":"watarāhum","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُعْرَضُونَ","en_gloss":"being exposed","transliteration":"yuʿ'raḍūna","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَـٰشِعِينَ","en_gloss":"humbled","transliteration":"khāshiʿīna","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"by","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلذُّلِّ","en_gloss":"disgrace","transliteration":"l-dhuli","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"looking","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"طَرْفٍ","en_gloss":"a glance","transliteration":"ṭarfin","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَفِىٍّۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"stealthy","transliteration":"khafiyyin","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And will say","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"42:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"42:4